      {"label": "A", "text": "have"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "had"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "were having"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "are having"}
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "“昨晚7点他们正在吃晚饭。”at 7 o'clock last night表示过去某个确切时间点，强调那个时刻正在进行的动作，用过去进行时。",
    "hint": "过去某个时间点正在做的事情用什么时态？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_3188",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "fill_blank",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": ["过去进行时", "语法"],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "While I ____(do) my homework, my brother was playing games.",
    "options": [],
    "answer": "was doing",
    "explanation": "while引导的从句表示同时进行的动作，两个动作都用过去进行时。I的过去进行时用was + doing。",
    "hint": "while常和过去进行时连用。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
