  {
    "id": "intellect_q_3189",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "tags": ["过去进行时", "语法"],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "when和while引导过去进行时有什么区别？",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "没有区别"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "when后面用短暂动作，while后面用持续动作"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "when后面用持续动作，while后面用短暂动作"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "两者都只能用短暂动作"}
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "when后面通常接短暂动作（一般过去时），while后面接持续动作（过去进行时）。例如：I was reading when he came in. / While I was reading, he came in.",
    "hint": "when强调时间点，while强调时间段。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_3190",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": ["词汇辨析", "词汇"],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "“borrow”和“lend”的区别是？",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "意思完全一样"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "borrow是借入，lend是借出"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "borrow是借出，lend是借入"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "borrow用于书，lend用于钱"}
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "borrow是“向别人借（借入）”，lend是“借给别人（借出）”。例如：Can I borrow your pen? / Can you lend me your pen?",
    "hint": "方向不同：一个是拿过来，一个是给出去。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_3191",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": ["词汇辨析", "词汇"],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "选择正确的词：I ____ two hours finishing the homework.",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "spent"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "cost"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "took"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "paid"}
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "explanation": "spend的句型是：人 + spend + 时间/金钱 + (in) doing sth. / on sth.。这里主语是I（人），所以用spent。",
    "hint": "主语是人时，用spend还是cost？",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_3192",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": ["词汇辨析", "词汇"],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "“too”、“also”和“either”都表示“也”，区别是？",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "没有区别"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "too和also用于肯定句，either用于否定句"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "三者都用于否定句"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "too用于否定句，either用于肯定句"}
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "explanation": "too放句末（肯定句），also放句中（肯定句），either放句末（否定句）。例如：I like it too. / I also like it. / I don't like it either.",
    "hint": "either出现在否定句中。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 30,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
