  {
    "id": "intellect_q_3195",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": ["阅读理解", "综合"],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "阅读短文：\n\"Tom is a 14-year-old boy. He gets up at 6:30 every morning and runs for half an hour. Then he has breakfast and goes to school. He likes math best because he thinks it's interesting. After school, he often plays basketball with his friends.\"\n\nTom最喜欢什么科目？",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "English"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "Chinese"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "Math"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "Science"}
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "短文中说“He likes math best because he thinks it's interesting.”（他最喜欢数学，因为他觉得数学有趣。）",
    "hint": "找到“likes...best”这个关键表达。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 45,
    "points": 15,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
  {
    "id": "intellect_q_3196",
    "module": "intellect",
    "type": "question",
    "subtype": "choice",
    "grade_min": 7,
    "grade_max": 9,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "tags": ["阅读理解", "综合"],
    "subject": "english",
    "stem": "根据上文，Tom每天早上跑步多长时间？",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "一个小时"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "半个小时"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "一刻钟"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "文中没说"}
    ],
    "answer": "B",
